<br><br>
	Thank you for choosing City of Bristol College,  your form has been recevied
	<br>
	<br>
	<h3>School Leavers (aged 16-18 or 19-23 with EHCP)</h3>
	If you are:
	<br>
	<ul>

		<li><strong>Applying</strong> - We will be processing your application for your guaranteed place at the College for September in the coming weeks. We will work with you to find a suitable date and time, for you meet with the course tutor to discuss the course in more depth. Your 'course information meeting' is where you are able to ask questions about the course content and understand how your course choice links with your career aspirations and predicted grades and it enables us to tell you more about the College. You will then be offered a suitable course and will proceed to the enrolling stage.</li>
		<li>
			<strong>Enrolling</strong> - Thank you for submitting the next stage of your enrolment, we will process the additional information you have provided and will be in contact with you shortly regarding what to expect next.
		</li>
	</ul>
	<br>
	<br>
	<h3>Adults</h3>
	If you are:
	<br>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Enquiring / Applying</strong> - Our Student Services team will be in contact with you shortly to discuss the next steps of your application or to provide you with the additional advice or information that you have requested regarding the course you are interested in, arrange interviews where appropriate and will let you know when the course is open for enrolment.		</li>
		<li><strong>Enrolling</strong> - If you have enrolled online, one of the team will process your request and confirm your place on the course or make contact directly with you as required. </li>
	</ul>
	<br>
	<br>
	We look forward to meeting you.
	<br>
	<br>
